'''Oración's Theme ~Let's Walk Together~''' (Japanese: '''オラシオンのテーマ　～共に歩こう～''' ''Orashion no Tēma ~Tomoni Arukō~'') is the Japanese ending theme for ''[[M20|I Choose You!]]''. The song is based on [[Oración]], an instrumental piece that played a major role in ''[[M10|The Rise of Darkrai]]''. It is performed by [[Asuca Hayashi]], who performed [[A Small Thing|the ending]] for ''[[M06|Jirachi: Wish Maker]]''.

The song was released as a [[List of Pokémon digital singles#Oración's Theme ~Let's Walk Together~|digital single]] on July 15, 2017, and is also included on the [[I Choose You! Music Collection]], which was released on July 26, 2017.

